CartModalWidget.showCartScreen(
  context,
  isHome: false,
  activeTable: "Table 5",
  cartItems: [
    {
      "title": "Espresso",
      "price": 60.0,
      "quantity": 2,
      "imageUrl": "[https://example.com/espresso.jpg](https://example.com/espresso.jpg)",
      "extras": ["Extra Shot"],
    }
  ],
  totalMokaPoints: 150.0,
  subtotal: 120.0,
  finalTotalPrice: 120.0,
  primaryColor: Colors.brown,
  onCheckout: () {
    print("Checkout confirmed!");
  },
);
isHome — A boolean flag that switches the delivery mode header; false (default).

activeTable — The identifier label for the current table; "Masa" (default).

cartItems — A list of maps containing product details; [] (default).

totalMokaPoints — The total amount of loyalty points available; 0.0 (default).

subtotal — The intermediate total cost; 0.0 (default).

finalTotalPrice — The ultimate calculated sum due after all adjustments; 0.0 (default).

onCheckout — Callback function triggered when the final order confirmation button is pressed.